{"4689960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"CarSim Racing","steam_appid":4689960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5353770],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CarSim Racing<\/strong> is a racing game where you start from the bottom with ordinary cars and work your way up to supercars, competing against the best racers!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 45 cars across different classes. Each vehicle is unique, with its own strengths and weaknesses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for two players on one PC<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of handcrafted tracks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track features secret routes where you can save a few seconds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive opponents who never give up until the very end.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CarSim Racing<\/strong> is a racing game where you start from the bottom with ordinary cars and work your way up to supercars, competing against the best racers!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 45 cars across different classes. Each vehicle is unique, with its own strengths and weaknesses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for two players on one PC<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of handcrafted tracks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track features secret routes where you can save a few seconds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra